    "findings_summary": "Rigorous investigation reveals that the 80-record curated sample exhibits complete separation primarily due to features A1_Score and A10_Score being 1 in all positive records and 0 in all controls. All target-derived variables (aq10_sum, result) were strictly purged from feature matrices to prevent target leakage. Preprocessing was enclosed in leakage-free pipelines. While models achieve 100% separation on this 80-record proof-of-concept subset, this performance is an artifact of the sample curation and does NOT represent generalizable clinical accuracy.",
